{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exit Denied</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game set inside a decaying mental asylum where something unnatural stalks the halls. You're trapped, weaponless, and constantly hunted by the\u00a0<strong>Morph</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you\u2019ll need to <strong>search the facility</strong>, gather hidden components, and <strong>build a weapon from scratch</strong>. But the Morph won't wait. It adapts. It listens. It <strong>knows</strong> you're trying to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the weapon is ready, <strong>the final confrontation begins</strong>. You\u2019ll have only one chance. And one shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer\u2019s Note:</strong> <i>\u201cExit Denied\u201d is my first released game. I\u2019m using this project to gain experience in game development.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Exit Granted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3878370/f2bc80a79d1b1b10b7bdc5930c356df593c602a4.jpg"},{"name":"Exit Denied","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3878370/427a53e50ff236b6ccbc4abec4da9c11bc9154bd.jpg"},{"name":"Subject: Missing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3878370/c64fd4dcc33d8a7528130c7976e71a0222dab063.jpg"},{"name":"They Were Here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3878370/6df7bfec9c573187a5eb299f11ce99d7fdb9202c.jpg"},{"name":"The Last Option","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3878370/35564096978e750bde3c76478eb10ca70125873b.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Locks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3878370/9387711d2d0e88f29d483dba17ddbf6e63c2d6f9.jpg"},{"name":"Path of Perfection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamco